CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1795789146
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHuw Edwards gives first interviews
OL,4,Asince child abuse image conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FChannel 4 has defended the documentary.
OL,7,FA spokesperson told the BBC that a
OL,8,F"highly experienced director" holds
OL,9,FEdwards to account with "no questions
OL,10,Foff limits, revealing his account of
OL,11,Fwhat led to his offending and very
OL,12,Fpublic downfall".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
