OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATributes for Duran Duran guitarist Andy
OL,4,ATaylor after his death aged 65
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaylor's wife Tracey called him "the
OL,7,Frock of our family", adding: "We will
OL,8,Fmiss him every single day." He died
OL,9,Fafter "a long and courageous battle
OL,10,Fwith prostate cancer", Duran Duran said
OL,11,Fin a statement on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
